<title>USA: Liz Claiborne sets buyback of more shares.</title>
<headline>Liz Claiborne sets buyback of more shares.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Liz Claiborne Inc said on Tuesday that it expanded its program to buy back common shares by an additional $75 million, bringing total authorizations up to $675 million.</p>
<p>As of February 17, the company had repurchased or had commitments to repurchase 21.5 million shares of common stock at an aggregate purchase price of $597 million.</p>
<p>Liz Claiborne has 71 million shares outstanding. The shares acquired will be available for use under the company's employee stock plans and for other general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
